The '''Gartside Plot''' is one of the many farms in [[Westfall]], and the only one other than [[Saldean's Farm]] that hasn't been taken over by the [[Defias Brotherhood]]. Though harvest golems roam the fields, [[Maltimor Gartside]] continues to eke out his existence in the solitary cottage and seeks to find an end to the killing machines that plague Westfall's fields.

